<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

  <%- include('partials/head', {
    title: 'Digital Performance Audit | CPG Development',
    description: 'Identify gaps and opportunities across analytics, search visibility, AI visibility, UX and digital performance with a CPG Development Digital Performance Audit.',
    canonical: 'https://cpg.dev/digital-performance-audit',

    schema: {
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@type': 'Service',
      '@id': 'https://cpg.dev/digital-performance-audit#service',
      name: 'Digital Performance Audit',
      url: 'https://cpg.dev/digital-performance-audit',
      description: 'A focused assessment of analytics, search visibility, AI visibility, user experience and digital performance.',
      provider: {
        '@id': 'https://cpg.dev/#organization'
      }
    }
  }) %>

</head>

<body>

  <%- include('partials/header', {
    currentPath: '/digital-performance-audit'
  }) %>


  <main id="main-content">


    <section class="service-hero">

      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Digital Performance Audit
        </p>

        <h1>
          Find Out What Your Digital Ecosystem Is Telling You
        </h1>

        <p class="service-hero__lead">
          Get a focused assessment of your digital measurement,
          search visibility, AI visibility and user experience,
          with prioritized recommendations for what to improve next.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="button button--primary"
        >
          Request an Audit
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          What We Evaluate
        </h2>

        <div class="service-detail-grid">

          <article>
            <h3>Measurement</h3>
            <p>
              Analytics configuration, conversion tracking,
              meaningful KPIs and reporting gaps.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Search Visibility</h3>
            <p>
              Technical and content factors affecting how your
              organization is discovered through search.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>AI Visibility</h3>
            <p>
              How effectively your digital presence supports
              discovery and understanding across emerging
              AI-driven experiences.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Digital Experience</h3>
            <p>
              Friction, usability issues and opportunities within
              important user journeys.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          What You Get
        </h2>

        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>A focused review of your current digital ecosystem</li>
          <li>Key measurement and visibility gaps</li>
          <li>High-value opportunities for improvement</li>
          <li>Prioritized recommendations</li>
          <li>Clear next steps</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          An Audit Designed to Lead to Action
        </h2>

        <p>
          The goal is not to produce a long document that sits
          unread. The audit is designed to identify the issues
          and opportunities that matter most and provide a practical
          path forward.
        </p>

        <p>
          If implementation is needed, CPG can also help execute
          the recommendations.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section final-cta">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          Start With a Clearer Picture
        </h2>

        <p>
          Tell us about your organization and what you want to
          understand or improve.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="button button--primary"
        >
          Request Your Digital Performance Audit
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


  </main>


  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>